      <activity id="fe201d51-f68b-5912-ad35-79cadd71d30f" activityNameId="c908069a-da8a-5e86-939c-8d758414cd2b" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Takeback and recycling, CdTe PV module</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Takeback and recycling, CdTe PV module
This dataset is based on information published in Sinha et al. (2011): End-of-Life CdTe PV Recycling with Semiconductor Refining.;
UUID: 0da72eaa-25cd-449d-a2d5-2529e402a345
This dataset includes the transport of used cadmium telluride photovoltaic modules to the recycling facility as well as their dismantling and recycling. The consumption of energy and auxiliary materials are also included. The disposal of plastic components is accounted for. The takeback and recycling of the electric installation and the mounting structure are not included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0da72eaa-25cd-449d-a2d5-2529e402a345.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
